ents.":"漿果會讓你的蛇成長並增加分數。金色漿果價值更高，且能讓蛇長兩節。","Hazards":"危險","Walls, rocks, hedges, and your own body end the round. Plan ahead — you cannot reverse.":"牆壁、岩石、樹籬和你自己的身體結束了這一輪。提前規劃——你無法逆轉。","Small rivals":"小對手","Golden rivals are prey: catch any part of one with your head to defeat it for a big bonus.":"黃金對手是獵物：用你的頭抓住獵物的任何部分來擊敗它以獲得巨額獎金。","Big rivals":"強勁對手","Dark plated rivals hunt you. Any contact is fatal. They telegraph by shape: spikes mean danger.":"黑鍍金的對手追捕你。任何接觸都是致命的。他們透過形狀傳達訊息：尖峰意味著危險。","Each round lists its goals. Complete all of them to win; finishing under par earns bonus points.":"每一輪都會列出其目標。完成所有任務即可獲勝；低於標準桿完成比賽可獲得獎勵積分。","Undo & hints":"復原與提示","Undo ({undo}) and hints ({hint}) are available in Practice. Pause with {pause}.":"實務上可以使用撤銷({undo})和提示({hint})。使用 {pause} 暫停。","Scoring":"計分","Score = food + growth + rival defeats + survival + objectives. Ties break on completion, then fewer invalid moves, then faster time.":"分數=食物+成長+對手失敗+生存+目標。平局在完成時打破，然後無效動作更少，然後時間更快。","Replay tutorials":"重播教學","← Back":"← 返回","Achievements":"成就","Cosmetics":"外觀","Cosmetics change looks only — never hitboxes, timing, or power.":"外觀僅改變外觀 — 絕不改變判定框、時機或能力。","{name} ({cost} mastery)":"{name}（{cost}精通）","Open journey map":"開放旅程地圖","Display name":"顯示名稱","Save":"儲存","Casual board — offline scores are not server-validated.":"休閒棋盤——離線分數未經伺服器驗證。","No scores yet. Be the first!":"尚無分數。成為第一個！","seed {seed}":"種子 {seed}","golden berry at column {x}, row {y}":"金色莓果位於 {x} 列、{y} 行","berry at column {x}, row {y}":"莓果位於 {x} 列、{y} 行","hunter at column {x}, row {y}":"獵人在{x}列、{y}行","Arena {w} by {h}. Serpent length {len}, heading {dir}, head at column {x}, row {y}.":"競技場 {w} × {h}。蛇長度 {len}，朝向 {dir}，頭部在欄 {x}、列 {y}。","Food: {list}.":"食物：{list}。","none":"無","Threats: {list}":"威脅：{list}","No hunters.":"沒有獵人。","Ranked":"排名","Unranked":"未排名","Morning Meadow":"早晨草地","Sunset Orchard":"日落果園","Moonlit Pond":"月光池塘","Autumn Hollow":"秋林幽谷","Coral Dunes":"珊瑚沙丘","First Slither":"第一位滑行者","Berry Trail":"漿果小徑","Long Way Round":"繞遠路","Mastery: The Open Field":"精通：開放領域","Growing Pains":"成長的煩惱","Coiled Garden":"盤繞花園","Mastery: Knotwork":"精通：打結","First Hunt":"第一次狩獵","Two in the Grass":"草叢中的兩個","Hunter's Picnic":"猎人的野餐","Mastery: Ambush Lanes":"精通：伏擊走廊","Something Bigger":"更大的東西","Keep Your Distance":"保持距離","Hunted Hunter":"被追捕的獵人","Mastery: Moonlit Chase":"精通：月光追逐","Golden Hour":"黃金時刻","Risk and Reward":"風險與回報","Mastery: High Roller":"精通：豪賭客","Quickened Pace":"加快步伐","Swift Current":"急流","Mastery: Blink":"精通：眨眼","Hedge Maze":"樹籬迷宮","Ring Around":"環環相扣","Mastery: The Warrens":"精通：華倫夫婦","Long Afternoon":"漫長午後","Stalemate":"僵局","Mastery: Marathon":"精通：馬拉松","Crossfire":"交叉火力","Tight Quarters":"狹小的宿舍","Mastery: Crucible":"精通：嚴酷試煉","Grand Meadow":"大草甸","Grand Orchard":"大果園","Grand Hollow":"大空洞","Grand Pond":"大池塘","Grand Dunes":"大沙丘","Mastery: The Grand Tour":"精通：壯遊","Needle's Eye":"針眼","Feeding Frenzy":"覓食狂潮","Apex Garden":"頂尖花園","Serpent's Due":"蛇的應得","The Long Coil":"長線圈","Mastery: Serpent Quest":"精通：蛇任務","Lesson 1: Steering":"課程 1：操控","Steer the serpent. Use arrow keys, WASD, swipe, or tap a tile to choose a direction.":"引導蛇。使用箭頭鍵、WASD、滑動或點擊圖塊來選擇方向。","Lesson 2: Eating & Growing":"課程 2：進食與成長","Eat 3 berries. Every berry makes you longer and adds to your score.":"吃3個漿果。每一顆漿果都會讓你變得更長，並增加你的分數。","Lesson 3: Danger":"課程 3：危險","Walls, stones, and your own body are lethal. Survive 40 ticks while growing to length 6.":"牆壁、石頭和你自己的身體都是致命的。存活 40 隻蜱蟲，同時長到長度 6。","Lesson 4: Hunting Rivals":"第4課：狩獵對手","Small golden rivals are prey. Catch one with your head to defeat it.":"小型黃金競爭對手是獵物。用你的頭抓住一個來擊敗它。","Lesson 5: Bigger Threats":"課程 5：更大威脅","Large dark rivals hunt YOU. Any touch is fatal. Survive 60 ticks.":"Large dark rivals hunt YOU.任何觸碰都是致命的。存活 60 個蜱蟲。","Counted Steps":"計算步數","Finish 8 berries within 90 moves.":"在 90 步內完成 8 個漿果。","Tailwind":"順風","High speed: eat 10 berries.":"High speed: eat 10 berries.","Hedgemaze":"樹籬迷宮","A dense garden cross. Reach length 12.":"一個密集的十字花園。達到長度12。","Rival Rush":"競爭對手衝刺","De